BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kikujiro (1999)
DTSTART:20261006T020000Z
DTEND:20261006T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20261006T020000Z
UID:v9u6M8NtRy
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 121 mins (2h01m)\n\nSeeking the mother he has never 
 met\, 9-year-old Masao forms an unlikely bond with the brash Kikujiro\, a 
 former yakuza who guides the child on a heart-warming and hilarious summer
  quest.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-open-road/kikujiro
 \n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
