DTEND:20261006T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20261006T020000Z
UID:Y8hYgB2caV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nAfter attending a workshop on ho
 w to write and sell a Hallmark movie\, filmmaker John Wilson tries to use 
 the same formula to sell a documentary about concrete.\n\nhttps://www.siff
 .net/cinema/in-theaters/the-history-of-concrete\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
