BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma
DTSTART:20261001T230000Z
DTEND:20261002T011000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T230000Z
UID:WAyqSuytUO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nAfter years of slapdash sequels 
 and waning fandom\, the Camp Miasma slasher franchise is handed over to an
  enthusiastic young director for resurrection. But when she visits the ori
 ginal movie’s star\, a now-reclusive actress shrouded in mystery\, the t
 wo women fall into a blood-soaked world of desire\, fear\, and delirium.\n
 \nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/teenage-sex-and-death-at-camp-mi
 asma\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ha-Chan\, Shake Your Booty
DTSTART:20261001T233000Z
DTEND:20261002T015000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T233000Z
UID:LUAnQ385hK
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 122 mins (2h02m)\n\nHaru and Luis love competing in 
 Tokyo's ballroom dance scene\, but after tragedy strikes\, Haru withdraws 
 into isolation. When friends coax her back to the studio\, she develops an
  infatuation with the new instructor.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-th
 eaters/ha-chan-shake-your-booty\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Resident Evil
DTSTART:20261001T234500Z
DTEND:20261002T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T234500Z
UID:upv3phm0Ij
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 89 mins (1h29m)\n\nFrom the mind of visionary filmma
 ker Zach Cregger (Weapons\, Barbarian) comes a thrilling — and terrify
 ing — reinvention of the Resident Evil franchise. In an all-new story\
 , Resident Evil follows Bryan (Austin Abrams)\, a medical courier who un
 wittingly finds himself in an action-packed\, non-stop race for survival a
 s one fateful\, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/resident-evil\n\nEstimated start: 17:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nature is a Language
DTSTART:20261002T020000Z
DTEND:20261002T035500Z
DTSTAMP:20261002T020000Z
UID:Wkw5SHDthk
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nPresented by Mount Analogue・Ar
 t + Cinema. Nature is a Language is a program of eleven artists’ films 
 made between 1994 and 2026\, and presented on 35mm and 16mm. Each work tak
 es a singular approach exploring space\, time\, and the relationship betwe
 en our constructed environments and the natural world.\n\nhttps://www.siff
 .net/cinema/in-theaters/nature-is-a-language\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Practical Magic 2
DTSTART:20261002T020000Z
DTEND:20261002T042500Z
DTSTAMP:20261002T020000Z
UID:Q6HpQpycfr
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 130 mins (2h10m)\n\nStarring Sandra Bullock and Nico
 le Kidman\, Practical Magic 2 returns to a world steeped in moonlit mischi
 ef and powerful ancestral magic\, as the Owens sisters must confront the d
 ark curse that threatens to unravel their family once and for all in a mus
 t-see cinematic event of fun\, magic and mayhem.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/c
 inema/in-theaters/practical-magic-2\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
