DESCRIPTION:Duration: 79 mins (1h19m)\n\nA boy discovers he can control th
 e global telephone system by whistling a magic tone. Born blind and yearni
 ng for connection\, his early obsession with the telephone sparks a subcul
 ture that shapes the future of hacking and technology.\n\nhttps://www.siff
 .net/cinema/in-theaters/joybubbles\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
