DTEND:20261019T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20261019T013000Z
UID:4sLWhmtNKA
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nOn October 20\, 1967\, Roger Pat
 terson captured 59 seconds of footage showing a creature walking through t
 he Northern California woods that became the most analyzed and debated in 
 film history. Fifty-seven years later\, a reel of 16mm stock discovered in
  a safe changes everything. Post-film Q&A with director Marq Evans.\n\nht
 tps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/capturing-bigfoot\n\nEstimated start
 : 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
